# World generation check: renders the terrain around the spawn column to images
# and statistics, then dumps state.
#
#   build/MineGame.exe --script scripts/worldgen.mgs --script-out automation_out/worldgen
#
# spawn_height.png / spawn_biome.png: 256x256 preliminary surface and biome.
# spawn_slice.png: X-Y slice through the spawn column from the bedrock floor to
# the generation ceiling, produced by the real generator into scratch chunks.
# spawn_worldgen.json: surface range, cube classes, timing, and the bedrock-floor
# and ceiling checks the regression runner asserts.

wait loaded
worldgen_preview spawn spawn spawn 256
state worldgen
quit
